- $u_i$: file_0_view_0.Capacity, with $i$ = file_0_view_0.VehicleType.
- $C$: $\sum_{i \in I} u_i$ (sum of file_0_view_0.Capacity).
- $x_i$: Number of vehicles of type $i$ to order per day (decision variable, integer, for each $i$).

